noidpow — NTMPool share-validation wrapper for ParanO(1)d (NOID) Poseidon2b PoW

This crate is a thin C-ABI wrapper. All consensus algorithm code is borrowed
unmodified (via Cargo path dependencies) from the ParanO(1)d project
(crates noid_chain / noid_poseidon2b / noid_core), licensed under the
Apache License 2.0. See the LICENSE file in this directory.

